ed by Abu Ma\\u2019shar, as \\u2018the knowledge of the effects of the powers of the stars, at a given time, as well as at a future time\\u2019, and he labelled it \\u2018science of the decrees of the stars\\u2019. Astronomy proper became \\u2018science of the spheres\\u2019 or \\u2018(science of the [heavenly] configurations\\u2019).\\u201d "}]', 'others': '{"usage.total_tokens": 2318, "temperature": 0.2}'}
